			"locked": false,
			"text": "| Functional Requirement       | Design Impact           |\n| ---------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| Send message                 | Message service + API   |\n| Receive message in real-time | WebSockets              |\n| Send images                  | Object storage (S3)     |\n| Message history              | Database schema         |\n| Read receipts                | Extra metadata + events |\n",
